{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30557","headline":"别宜春赴举 · 卢肇","name":"别宜春赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋天草木正萧疎，西望秦关别旧居。\n筵上芳樽今日酒，箧中黄卷古人书。\n辞乡且伴衔芦雁，入海终爲戴角鱼。\n长短九霄飞直上，不敎毛羽落空虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢肇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}